&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in Python in a production environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to work in a fast-paced, collaborative and geographically distributed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork abilities&lt;/li&gt;
