&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please only apply to the one job you feel best fits your skillset and experience. If our team feels you are better suited for another role, we will reach out about the alternate opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Front-end developers at Squarepoint are instrumental in enhancing user experience on our sophisticated research and trading platforms. You will use React and Typescript to develop fully-fledged applications facilitating real-time data access, and support the exploration of large volumes of data integral to our trading workflows and operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Your contributions will drive rapid decision-making and uphold our competitive edge in a high-stakes trading environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or other degree with a heavy emphasis on software development,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 4 years experience in a relevant role such as software development,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Experience in web development using a modern React stack with TypeScript,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to pick up and learn new technologies and frameworks,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
