&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with git and Linux,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with relational or document store databases,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an investment or financial business is useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

