db2aa3192a7ffc9c76b9869408f01d5cdca19492:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Risk Technology is a global team that designs, builds and maintains Squarepoint’s trading risk platform, which is responsible for trade capture, position management, profit/loss computation, inventory/locate management and internal order routing. These critical systems need to be performant, resilient, and capable of timely processing of high volumes of trading data in both live and historical scenarios, requiring solutions to process, propagate and store rapidly changing datasets efficiently. The Risk platform is undergoing significant investment to build a new service orientated architecture. We’re looking for talented engineers with a passion for software development who enjoy working in a dynamic, global and collaborative environment, with a strong focus on engineering excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Engineering, Computer Science or related subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years’ C++ Linux based development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data structures and algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Team player with excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with scalable large-scale / distributed systems / service-oriented architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience optimizing code for high performance applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with messaging systems (e.g., Kafka, AMPS, QPID)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, bash and/or Q/KDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

2a674b1e64cf11ddd92da8eab437ef5e78292e88:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Squarepoint is looking for a Desktop Support Analyst to support a global community of approximately 500 + users in a Windows environment. Candidate will interact onsite and remotely with users to provide support with workstation applications such as Microsoft Exchange/Outlook, Microsoft Office in an on premise or cloud-based solution; access control policies via Windows Active Directory; remote access assistance and hardware issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide 24x5 support on-site and to a global community of approximately 500 + users as per business requirement;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide on-call weekend support on a rotational basis;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage raised requests and incidents in a timely manner following well-rehearsed internal request runbooks/knowledge based and incident management and request fulfillment processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Level 2 &amp;amp; 3 internal and external teams/vendors as appropriate to help troubleshoot more complex incidents;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide alert management to pro-active resolve failure alerts, degraded services and unavailable services through internal monitoring tools;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively automate common tasks to improve efficiency and increase productivity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal and external teams to develop strategic solutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform related duties &amp;amp; responsibilities as requested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed knowledge and experience in a Microsoft environment supporting Windows 10, Windows Server 2012+, Office Suite including Outlook, Office 365 and Azure, including OneDrive, DLP and SharePoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed knowledge and experience with Active Directory, Group Policy, remote access solutions and software deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed knowledge and experience installing, troubleshooting and managing desktop hardware;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentless dedication to customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with minimum supervision, proactively follows up on outstanding issues/tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple tasks with changing priorities and capable to handle frequent interruptions positively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, prioritizing, interpersonal, problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated collaborative skills and ability to work well within a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced and deadline-oriented environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with critical attention to detail, deadlines and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in learning about new and emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed learner and ability to find solutions to problems they have not encountered before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Engineering or related field or experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal !msorm;&quot;&gt;Nice to have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Powershell and Python;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

fce8890be243a8754e3bb7394b573ea66761b46a:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of Support Analyst - Trade Flow Pilot:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate on-boarding and migration of trading flows with technology and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipe cleaning of new asset classes to be traded in the firm using internal applications and broker/exchanges before the full-scale trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gatekeep the production environment by reviewing the changes in technology space; Create and maintain internal tools and scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typical Day of Support Analyst:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct scheduled pipe cleaning activities with regional trading desks and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out analysis, planning &amp;amp; execution for any ongoing on boarding, migration projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and provide feedback on changes going into production wherever gaps are identified, CAB approval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide assistance to trade floor support, operations and trading desks on any queries raised related to the trading flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skill Set Required for Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, engineering, or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the financial domain and different types of asset classes (at least listed ones - Equities &amp;amp; Derivatives)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate with colleagues across multiple regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Linux based environments and proficiency in at least one scripting language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of trading fundamentals, including market types and asset classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, kdb+/q experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

c7cf7b9a54f03c5f809080133f9da7f58259da5f:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;2129101c-1601-417b-b247-cd8704e5b69b&quot;&gt;As a Technical Business Analyst , you will be the key driver of the entire project lifecycle; starting from using requirements elicitation techniques to gather business requirements, identify problems or discover gaps, evaluate project objectives and track progress, to ultimately ensure successful delivery of the project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;2129101c-1601-417b-b247-cd8704e5b69b&quot;&gt;This presents the opportunity to take ownership of the business objectives and the development of technology solutions to facilitate the growth of the business. You will act as the primary interface between senior stakeholders, Business Product Management Team, Quantitative Research, Trading, Development, Quality Assurance, Production Support and Infrastructure Teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The main responsibilities for&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Technical Business Analysts&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze current business processes and establish the full picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical needs and problems to solve based on thorough analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and scope requirements into technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end solutions, propose implementation options, provide evaluations and recommendations to make optimal decisions for the firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the product design that aligns with firm-wide goals by collaborating with business and technology stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain product and project specifications with exceptionally high level of accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage functional/technical knowledge and content and drive outstanding questions towards closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish project implementation plan and proactively&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;bb771112-4332-4df9-ae92-ff32af981d89&quot;&gt;monitor&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;project progress while managing multiple priorities and communicating the priorities effectively to the project stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate for this role should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong requirement elicitation skills: ability to capture, conceptualize and structure requirements to simple, concise and comprehensive requirement specifications to minimize requirement gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation skills: ability to create and maintain highly accurate requirement specifications, project and product documents according to Squarepoint documentation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to abstract concepts, identify gaps and subtle differences, connect dots, internalize information, relate information to implications and question effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop and maintain strategic partnerships with senior management, project stakeholders and end users globally, as well as communicate effectively across business and development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding on software/hardware concepts, software architecture design and software development lifecycle (Waterfall or Agile).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of various asset classes in either listed or OTC financial instruments such as Equities, Futures, Options or Fixed Income instruments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, independent, reliable, collaborative and strong sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-organized, exceptionally high level of accuracy in both written and verbal communication and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on multiple projects simultaneously across different&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;3a4e17ad-2179-4cab-93d1-3fdf974818b4&quot;&gt;domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 to 10 years of total industry experience within finance with at least 2 years in a Technical Business Analyst position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on programming experience is required, preferably in Python or KDB+/q.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atlassian Confluence and JIRA expertise is required, including corresponding macros/plug-ins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in initiating, defining, driving&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;096bfc8b-84c8-431f-99f0-9604e2647703&quot;&gt;and implementing&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;projects with explicitly scoped project milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in a Computer Science, Engineering field or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Microservice, Domain-Driven Design, API Design, cloud-native applications, distributed systems and DevOps is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

b9cc73afca12b347a81d6c99e0f1769955241f7d:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integration projects team plays a crucial role in the analysis, planning, and coordination of upgrades, rollouts, and decommission across firm’s trading, research, and UX’s front-to-back workflows. As an integral member of team, you will collaborate closely with a wide range of technology teams and quantitative researchers, offering you the opportunity to gain a deep understanding of technology architecture, business operations, and to develop your project management and organizational skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Project manage large scale firm wide roll outs of applications and infrastructure, user migrations from legacy to newer systems, high impact changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Project manage business/external driven requirements requiring cross team coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Act as liaison between technology teams, business users and external parties during various stages of application and infrastructure delivery for in-scope projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Increase transparency for stakeholders by maintaining quality project tracking documentation and regular communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Use of scripting/automations for project impact assessment and data collection for migration tracking dashboards.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, Engineering, or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, organizational, and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of software/hardware/network concepts, software development life cycle and processes around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Linux OS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Bash and any scripting language such as Python or Perl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MS SQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Atlassian stack (JIRA, Service Desk, Confluence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
