fb694ec1499cdb7adca56235c64cea7b519eb7ee:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Manager on the Systematic Business Management team, you will partner with colleagues across Boston and London to support the operations, growth, and strategic priorities of the Systematic business unit. No two days look the same. Your work will span product launch support, strategic initiative coordination, meeting and materials preparation, and ensuring the broader needs of the business are met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who thrives on variety, takes ownership of problems, and can move fluidly between independent workstreams and close cross-functional collaboration. A background in investment management, product structuring, or experience within an investment management organization will position you to hit the ground running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role and responsibilities will include&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Governance&lt;/strong&gt; Support the growth of the Systematic Micro and Macro product ecosystem. While product launches are coordinated by the Product Management team, you will support the governance framework and provide tailored ongoing support for each client: including onboarding coordination, documentation, and lifecycle tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management&lt;/strong&gt; Lead projects of varying size, complexity, and subject matter. These will primarily support investment-related initiatives but will regularly span central functions such as Legal, Operations, Technology, and Compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Operational Risk&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify areas where business processes can be streamlined or strengthened. Propose and coordinate improvements while building a working understanding of the unit&#39;s operational risk landscape and supporting related needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management &amp;amp; Tracking&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and organize key business data including terms and agreement tracking with Legal, operational risk, commercial data, and project dashboards, ensuring information is accurate, accessible, and up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meeting Coordination &amp;amp; Follow-Through&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare materials for and coordinate meetings and committees. Drive follow-ups and accountability on action items to keep initiatives moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ad-Hoc Strategic Support&lt;/strong&gt; In a fast-moving environment, priorities shift. You&#39;ll be expected to step into emerging challenges with energy and resourcefulness, helping the team respond to evolving business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Communication &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage projects end-to-end: scoping requirements, setting timelines, delegating tasks, and driving deliverables to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying and implementing process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills, able to build trust quickly across teams and levels of seniority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify team needs, synthesize information, and present clear recommendations to management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in building relationships with key stakeholders across a global organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Working Style&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-directed and resourceful&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— you prioritize your own workload, operate effectively in ambiguity, and drive work forward without waiting for detailed instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable wearing multiple hats&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— you can shift between strategic thinking and hands-on execution in the same day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in productivity and presentation tools (PowerPoint, Excel, Visio) and comfort leveraging AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine curiosity about how the Systematic business unit, and Man Group more broadly operates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical aptitude or familiarity with development lifecycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with investment product structuring or fund operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Business Management, Finance, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;About 5 years of experience in project management, business management, or a comparable operational role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead initiatives and influence stakeholders without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated analytical thinking, able to synthesize information from multiple sources and deliver actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong time management skills with the ability to balance multiple concurrent priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Thrive Here If You…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are energized by variety and genuinely enjoy connecting dots across teams and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in driving things to completion even when the path isn&#39;t fully mapped out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Want to deeply understand how an investment business operates, from portfolio construction to client delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value collaboration but don&#39;t need hand-holding to get things done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The anticipated based salary range for this position is listed below. Compensation packages would also include benefits and a discretionary bonus. This is the base salary range that the Company believes it will pay for this position at the time of this posting based on the location and requirements of the position as well as the skills, qualifications, and experience of the applicant.&amp;nbsp; The Firm reserves the right to modify this pay range at any time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4081ce78897f1bb3ba004b4275f36445a55bd5c9:
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Core Data team models and owns the structured datasets that connect Squarepoint to the outside world, effectively representing the firm&#39;s view of reality. We partner closely with portfolio managers and investment researchers to define robust data models and build reliable data pipelines that transform and consolidate diverse sources into high-quality, centrally managed datasets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These datasets are delivered through a service-oriented platform designed for scalability, reliability, and performance. Our technology supports every stage of the investment lifecycle, from research and backtesting to trading and portfolio management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for talented software engineers with strong Python and/or kdb+/q experience to join our team. You will be part of a collaborative, learning-oriented environment where excellence is recognized, diverse perspectives are valued, and innovative solutions are encouraged.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquire a deep understanding of the data requirements provided by investment research teams and deliver solutions that create business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, test, optimize and troubleshoot data pipelines and services using Python and q&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a range of database technologies, including PostgreSQL and kdb+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze, onboard, and curate vendor datasets, becoming a subject matter expert in third-party data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a leading role in production support and operational excellence during business hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python and/or kdb+/q&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing software in a Linux environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and a willingness to learn new technologies, tools, and frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SQL and experience with relational and/or time-series databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating data-intensive applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with and analyzing financial datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

00d96e57d72d23053028632d72842dc162dcaa77:
&lt;div id=&quot;main-content&quot; class=&quot;wiki-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Development group manages the lifecycle of data used for trading, back-testing, and research at Squarepoint. We work with quantitative researchers and tech teams to integrate, process, and serve data from a huge variety of sources into our data infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently seeking new data developers to join our Data Platform team, where teamwork and collaboration are encouraged, excellence is rewarded and diversity of thought and creative solutions are valued. Our emphasis is on a culture of learning, development, and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Platform is a team of Python developers working closely with technology developers and quantitative developers to design, build, test, and maintain libraries, services and frameworks used by data pipelines and investment teams across the entire Squarepoint organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Platform is able to deploy infrastructure, frameworks and tools to the rest of the Squarepoint business at speed, with stability, observability, access control and performance at top of mind. Services and libraries are resilient and highly maintainable. Data models are carefully designed in close collaboration with our domain experts for efficient application development, predictable behavior and ease of debugging. Data Platform developers also support developers in adopting and efficiently using the tools and products developed, and increase the team&#39;s quality of life, throughput, and code quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquire a deep understanding of the interface and tooling requirements of developers to deliver the right solutions to them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, test, optimize and troubleshoot Python libraries, frameworks, and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and add features to React frontends when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with technologists to ensure that our data applications and data platform meet evolving business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with data operations and data pipeline developers to improve development velocity and reduce our technical debt; increase the team&#39;s quality of life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and review technical documents, such as requirements docs for new features, design docs to propose new platform solutions, and production support runbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lend a hand in support operations - during normal working hours - to help troubleshoot higher-order production issues when first line support personnel require deeper investigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Only candidates with more than 4 full years of relevant experience will be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a STEM subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills programming in Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of commonly used protocols and tools used to transfer data (e.g. FTP, SFTP, HTTP APIs, AWS S3).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years designing, testing, optimizing and troubleshooting data intensive applications or services, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across multiple techincal domains: such as web development, data engineering, backend development, operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with any of these: SQL, JavaScript, TypeScript, React, C++, Rust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PostgreSQL, Redis or Valkey, FastAPI, Kubernetes, Helm, Hashicorp Vault, Hashicorp Nomad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;likes-and-labels-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;likes-section&quot; class=&quot;no-print&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

c55d142eb871b7097d41497e6db1b1c4b31fa333:
&lt;h4 id=&quot;SoftwareDeveloperDataReliability-PositionOverview&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Reliability Software Engineer on the Data team, you will be central to the infrastructure and operations that keep Squarepoint&#39;s data ecosystem running at scale. Our mandate is broad by design: we own the pipelines, platforms, and automation that our technology and investment teams depend on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team operates at the intersection of engineering and operations. We build the observability tooling that surfaces problems before they become incidents, the job orchestration platform that runs production workloads at scale, the self-serve systems that let teams move faster without creating risk, and the production pipelines that onboard new data from various vendors. When incidents arise, we lead the response: root cause, remediation, and the follow-through that prevents recurrence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with quant researchers, traders, and engineers across our organization, as well as the external vendors who supply our data, building strong working relationships while developing deep expertise in the systems that underpin their work. We value ownership, sharp analytical thinking, and engineers who take pride in leaving things better than they found them. If you thrive in an environment where your work has direct, visible impact on the reliability of critical systems and where no two days look the same, then this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;SoftwareDeveloperDataReliability-Responsibilities&quot;&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a97e22ab-631d-41b1-ba85-a46993abcf5f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Keep Data Development infrastructure healthy, building the health monitoring platform with configurable monitors and custom checks that surfaces problems before they become incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;339856ba-6d76-4aac-98d9-5cbcf589ad38&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Automation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build and improve automation that streamlines operational tasks and workflows, including the job orchestration platform that runs production workloads at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;2c39fa16-ff65-4f39-a754-f2bcac72a224&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Serve Request Automation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build the Jira-driven platform that executes operational requests end to end, letting teams move faster without creating risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;9ff70328-a609-4216-9405-92c926d81905&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Onboard new datasets from various vendors, and build the pipelines and frameworks that make that work scalable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;2b384863-39d7-4724-9135-45800cd9d4b9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Own deployments, support users, plan for capacity and performance, and lead incident resolution end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;SoftwareDeveloperDataReliability-RequiredQualifications&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;dc6f34db-1762-47d6-82d0-83dfb1970559&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;5cb2f3fd-ae4e-4658-8b67-23e656e88a56&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;4+ years of proven experience in Software Engineering, Software Reliability, or a similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;dc3f9d49-f601-4714-b09a-23e432d2e79d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;3+ years of hands-on experience programming in Python, and familiarity with version control systems such as Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;f053986b-a8df-4355-9012-fe4ba2c2864e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linux:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proficiency with the Linux command line&lt;/li&gt;
