&lt;li&gt;Packaging, maintaining platform as a service build blocks such as stream services, data orchestrators, databases, caches, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing innovation to the Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A master’s degree or PhD in computer science or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3–7 years of experience working with Kubernetes as both a user and administrator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in one or more programming languages, including Python, Rust, Go, or C++, with strong knowledge of system programming, Linux, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure as code, large-scale configuration management systems, observability practices and tooling, and distributed systems such as Kafka and Etcd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of infrastructure technologies and protocols, including DNS, networking, security, enterprise storage solutions, and GPU operations and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to troubleshoot complex systems and collaborate effectively in large-scale infrastructure environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower’s headquarters are in the historic Equitable Building, right in the heart of NYC’s Financial District and our impact is global, with over a dozen offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, we believe work should be both challenging and enjoyable. That is why we foster a culture where smart, driven people thrive – without the egos. Our open concept workplace, casual dress code, and well-stocked kitchens reflect the value we place on a friendly, collaborative environment where everyone is respected, and great ideas win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Savings plans and other financial wellness tools available in each region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast, lunch, and snacks daily&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office wellness experiences and reimbursement for select wellness expenses (e.g., gym, personal training and more)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-sponsored sports teams and fitness events (JPM Corporate Challenge, Cycle for Survival, Wall Street Rides FAR and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteer opportunities and charitable giving&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, happy hours, treats, and celebrations throughout the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workshops and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, you’ll find a collaborative and welcoming culture, a diverse team and a workplace that values both performance and enjoyment. No unnecessary hierarchy. No ego. Just great people doing great work – together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower Research Capital is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;

f0dd738e-2186-4030-9793-ab73281981ef:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a qualified Executive Assistant to support a small team of Portfolio Managers at Schonfeld in Singapore. The ideal candidate is self-motivated, professional, and capable of managing a diverse workload and prioritizing tasks in a fast-paced corporate environment.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with many hats; this candidate will be responsible for extensive scheduling and calendar management, preparing agendas for meetings, expenses, answering phones and taking messages. They will arrange domestic and international travel, accommodations, itineraries, and all correspondence related to arrangements including flights, hotels, car service, meetings, restaurant reservations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you need:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written &amp;amp; verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Outlook and Microsoft Office Suite (Word, Excel, Powerpoint)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and manage multiple streams of information &amp;amp; tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process-oriented and very strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Efficient time management and strong sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational and time-management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-Starter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personable, mature, and poised&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’d love if you had:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Navan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with organizing events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who we are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Schonfeld is a global multi-manager hedge fund that strives to deliver industry-leading risk-adjusted returns for our investors. We leverage both internal and external portfolio manager teams around the world, seeking to capitalize on inefficiencies and opportunities within the markets. We draw from decades of experience and a significant investment in proprietary technology, infrastructure and risk analytics to invest across four main strategies: Quant, Tactical, Fundamental Equity and Discretionary Macro &amp;amp; Fixed Income.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Our Culture&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Schonfeld, we’ll invest in you. Attracting and retaining top talent is at the heart of what we do, because we believe that exceptional outcomes begin with exceptional people. We foster a culture where talent is empowered to continually learn, innovate and pursue ambitious goals. We are teamwork-oriented, collaborative and encourage ideas—at all levels—to be shared. As an organization committed to investing in our people, we provide learning and educational offerings and opportunities to make an impact. We encourage community through internal networks, external partnerships and service initiatives that promote inclusion and purpose beyond the firm’s walls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

8a4255be6ef9e5b42b9e29277a7b6a64200106bd:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This internship is based in London and is available throughout the year. Please indicate your preferred start month in the application questions.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The minimum length of the Internship must be&amp;nbsp;12 weeks.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Squarepoint&amp;nbsp;sits at the intersection of finance, mathematics, and technology. From petabyte-scale data platforms to ultra-low-latency trading systems, we build the infrastructure that powers systematic investing across every major asset class and market worldwide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for highly motivated students with a deep passion for technology and software development to join our&amp;nbsp;Software&amp;nbsp;Developer&amp;nbsp;Internship program. As a participant in the internship program, you will work closely with experienced engineers to develop and deliver custom software solutions that solve complex problems.&amp;nbsp;During your time with us,&amp;nbsp;you will work in collaboration with your mentors on&amp;nbsp;a project that has a visible impact&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;the business.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have internship opportunities across various teams&amp;nbsp;including;&amp;nbsp;Data Engineering, Risk, Market Data, Quant Development, Frontend and&amp;nbsp;many more...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fast-paced training program to give you an introduction to all technical&amp;nbsp;facets&amp;nbsp;of software development in the algorithmic trading industry&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The software you build and the projects you work on will be&amp;nbsp;leveraged&amp;nbsp;to support active and ongoing trading with the markets  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent programming projects in Python or C++&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intern social events to let you network with other&amp;nbsp;Squarepoint&amp;nbsp;employees and explore the city where&amp;nbsp;you’re&amp;nbsp;spending your internship&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursuing a degree in Computer Science, Computer/Electrical Engineering,&amp;nbsp;Mathematics&amp;nbsp;or equivalent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates must be in penultimate year of study&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of one or more of the following programming languages: Python, C++, Java, Rust, C&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Unix systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep passion for technology&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;strong communication&amp;nbsp;skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

a4efc5d0-a827-41cb-801e-b326ac328750:
&lt;p&gt;Quantbot Technologies is a leading global quantitative investment firm deploying systematic strategies across asset classes. At the heart of our approach is large-scale research powered by advanced computing infrastructure and petabytes of comprehensive market and historical data. We combine rigorous scientific methods with modern statistical and machine learning techniques to discover, test, and implement novel investment ideas.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Data Trading Analyst Intern, you’ll have the opportunity to work with Quantbot’s Data Trading Lab team, a technical group specializing in trading operations, data science, and problem-solving. You will evaluate new datasets, and utilize our advanced cloud environment to write and maintain Python scripts. You will work directly with the Hong Kong team to process and assess new datasets and take part in developing new tools and infrastructure at Quantbot.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct exploratory data analysis on alternative datasets to explore datasets for potentially predictive signals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform statistical analysis including correlation studies, regression analysis, and time-series modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build ETL processes to integrate new data sources with existing research infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data quality monitoring tools to detect anomalies and ensure dataset integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize existing scripts for performance and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build internal Python libraries or tools to standardize common analytical workflows across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrollment in a Bachelor’s, Master’s, or PhD program in Computer Science or Data Science related field. Seniors and students in their penultimate year are encouraged to apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Linux or UNIX environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SQL queries and any relational database systems is preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance knowledge is beneficial but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This 10 to 12-week program runs from June to August, offering training and support with a dedicated mentor. Successful interns may receive full-time job offers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join a global team that values a relaxed, collaborative environment. Enjoy company outings, traditional Friday lunches, and a focus on work-life balance. Quantbot is committed to fostering an inclusive workplace where all employees can thrive. Join us for a dynamic opportunity to grow with a pioneering quant firm and acquire skills for your future career.&lt;/p&gt;

