024c5a73aaf3b9d2ca4b0f50201ef8224b5e98b1:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firm Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verition Fund Management LLC (“Verition”) is a multi-strategy, multi-manager hedge fund founded in 2008. Verition focuses on global investment strategies including Fixed Income &amp;amp; Macro, Event &amp;amp; Multi-Asset RV, Equity L/S &amp;amp; Capital Markets, and Quantitative Trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Operations team is responsible for the processes and infrastructure supporting the firm&#39;s investment activity across strategies, products, and markets globally. Partnering closely with Portfolio Managers, Trading, Risk, Technology, and external counterparties (prime brokers, custodians, and fund administrators), the team manages the end-to-end trade lifecycle, including trade capture and settlement, position and cash reconciliations, corporate actions, and regulatory reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verition is seeking a motivated Operations Specialist to join its TRS Operations team. This role manages trade lifecycle events across an array of asset classes with a primary focus on Total Return Swaps, partnering closely with Trading, Fund Accounting, Technology, and Risk. The Specialist resolves day-to-day trade breaks across multiple swap counterparties, supports swap resets and trade bookings, and owns daily transaction, position, and cash reconciliations for TRS products in Geneva.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage trade lifecycle events across an array of asset classes with a primary focus on Total Return Swaps, partnering with Trading, Fund Accounting, Technology, and Risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve day-to-day trade breaks across multiple swap counterparties, working with front office and global operations teams to identify and resolve discrepancies promptly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support swap resets, trade bookings, corporate action processing, and P&amp;amp;L inquiries; perform daily reconciliations in Geneva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review daily transaction, position, and cash reconciliations for TRS products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process gaps and partner with internal and external stakeholders to develop and implement solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help senior management streamline workflows and minimize operational risk by keeping sight of big-picture objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong working relationships with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform thorough due diligence to fully resolve issues in a timely manner, avoiding financial or reputational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date knowledge of industry best practices to help develop effective operational policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree required, preferably with a concentration in finance, economics, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of relevant work experience in fund or trade operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Geneva preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General knowledge of financial instruments (equities, fixed income, options, swaps, futures, FX) across domestic and global securities markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to engage professionally and effectively with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, and strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The annual base salary range for this position is $100,000 to $150,000 (USD). In addition to base salary, this position is eligible for a discretionary performance bonus and a comprehensive benefits package. Actual compensation offered to the successful candidate will be determined based on a variety of factors such as geographic location, work experience, qualifications, and skill level.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

