&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;We are excited to offer a unique opportunity for a diverse group of talented students to join the internship program at Schonfeld. Over the course of ten weeks, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;you will&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; become an integral part of our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Cyber&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;security&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;group within the Schonfeld Technology division. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;You will&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; be immersed in Schonfeld’s collaborative culture, working alongside cybersecurity professionals on impactful, real-world projects addressing today’s most pressing threats.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;The Cybersecurity Department at Schonfeld is dedicated to safeguarding the firm’s data, assets, and reputation from both internal and external threats, while securely enabling the business to innovate and grow in an increasingl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;y complex threat landscape.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;It includes Security Engineering, Security &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Operations,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;, Ri&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;k, and Complia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;nce &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;teams.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;The Cybersecurity Operations team is seeking a hands-on individual who sets the standard for incident response, threat management and risk mitigation while driving continuous improvement of our security controls.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
