&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Squarepoint has a newly created role for an experienced payroll accountant to join their growing management company accounting team.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
