&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking an exceptional intern to join our Discretionary Macro Fixed Income (DMFI) Quant team in London where you will have an opportunity to meaningfully contribute to building and enhancing our derivatives pricing and risk infrastructure, delivering solutions that directly impact our trading operations across multiple asset classes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
