&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;Our Technology Internship programme invites you to spend &lt;strong&gt;3, 4 or &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; months (depnding on indvidual circumstance)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;fully embedded in one of our teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;, tackling impactful projects that drive technological advancement and deliver meaningful business impact. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; receive formal training and comprehensive support from a dedicated &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;buddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; and mentor who will guide your development and help you navigate the organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; We also host knowledge sharing sessions and intern-specific events to help you build a broader understanding of Man Group and the wider financial services industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;Your projects will span &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; technology domains such as software development, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;DevOps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; and data engineering, with the opportunity to enhance our quantitative investment platform, integrate new datasets, extend our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; and order management systems, and contribute to our core technology platform. You will build a deep understanding of our business and the financial markets by working closely with teams across Portfolio Management, Trading, Risk, Responsible Investment, Operations and more, and you&#39;ll have the chance to present your project to senior management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
