fe289d8a-b69a-4394-a781-0a2e327a853c:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly qualified Associate to work in our Regulatory Reporting team. The Regulatory Reporting team partners with Compliance, Finance, Risk, Treasury, Operations, and Technology to ensure complete, accurate, and timely regulatory disclosures in every jurisdiction where the firm trades. As an Associate you will both run existing processes and help shape the future of regulatory compliance at the firm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute on key recurring and ad hoc regulatory filings and ownership disclosures (SEC, CFTC, FCA, MAS, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and monitor data quality rules to ensure the accuracy of regulatory filings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write detailed business process documentation and calculation specifications for regulatory filings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand, execute, and contribute to code (SQL/Python) to aggregate datasets and automate processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand all the datasets available for reporting and scope out which datasets are appropriate for the given filing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with internal partner teams as well as external vendors to help build out reporting processes and infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform ad hoc data analysis to answer questions from partner teams and regulators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you need:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s or master’s degree in finance/accounting/economics or STEM; CPA / CFA a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of relevant work experience at a buy-side firm, consulting agency, or managed service provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with certain regulatory reports like Form PF, CPO-PQR, Annex IV, 13F, 13G, 13H, Form ADV, and MAS surveys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational programming skills in Python and experience with relational and non-relational databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of a variety of different hedge fund strategies and comfort dealing with a wide array of asset classes (Equities, Futures, Options, FX, Bonds, Swaps, Credit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and oral communication skills; able to thrive in a fast-paced multi-PM environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impeccable attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’d love it if you had:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Asia and EMEA reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior software engineering, data engineering, or business intelligence experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior audit, financial reporting, or fund accounting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI in a compliance or reporting setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who we are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Schonfeld is a global multi-manager hedge fund that strives to deliver industry-leading risk-adjusted returns for our investors. We leverage both internal and external portfolio manager teams around the world, seeking to capitalize on inefficiencies and opportunities within the markets. We draw from decades of experience and a significant investment in proprietary technology, infrastructure and risk analytics to invest across four main strategies: Quant, Tactical, Fundamental Equity and Discretionary Macro &amp;amp; Fixed Income.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Our Culture&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Schonfeld, we’ll invest in you. Attracting and retaining top talent is at the heart of what we do, because we believe that exceptional outcomes begin with exceptional people. We foster a culture where talent is empowered to continually learn, innovate and pursue ambitious goals. We are teamwork-oriented, collaborative and encourage ideas—at all levels—to be shared. As an organization committed to investing in our people, we provide learning and educational offerings and opportunities to make an impact. We encourage community through internal networks, external partnerships and service initiatives that promote inclusion and purpose beyond the firm’s walls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base pay for this role is expected to be between $120,000 and $200,000. The expected base pay range is based on information at the time this post was generated. This role may also be eligible for other forms of compensation such as a performance bonus and a competitive benefits package. Actual compensation for the successful candidate will be determined based on a variety of factors such as skills, qualifications, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DK1&lt;/p&gt;

8bbcdf8bae7432aa9a85394b5e188f2c784610d7:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Overall responsibility for writing Man Group level content, including the development of Group-wide marketing materials, creating and maintaining high-quality questionnaire content and management of the content management system. This content will need to be prepared on a regular basis for use with Man&#39;s institutional and retail client base. The successful applicant will be expected to produce topical and professional content and materials quickly, efficiently and to a very high standard. Based in London, the role will involve working closely with a wide range of senior stakeholders across Man Group.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume a critical role within Man’s Global Investment Specialist team, with a distinct focus on Man Group level content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain Man Group level marketing materials, alongside high-level overview/introductory content on Man’s Discretionary, Systematic and Solutions capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with key stakeholders across the business to create Man level RFP/DDQ and marketing content of the highest quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write answers and maintain the integrity of Man level answers within Man’s proprietary central RFP database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that the latest research, analysis and messaging is incorporated into all content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong working relationships with senior sales/portfolio managers/Compliance/Legal and middle office stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities and initiate projects from a Man Group perspective where Investment Specialists can add value for the wider business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree level education in a relevant discipline required. Financial qualification preferred, or working towards qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approx. 1-3 years’ Client Service or content creation experience within the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of the asset management industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with and manage a wide variety of stakeholders, including senior Portfolio Management and Sales individuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail paramount to ensure the highest quality content is distributed to clients at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal. Proficient in understanding institutional / retail client expectations and requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and time management skills. Ability to prioritise work effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently within a team to meet demanding deadlines. Works comfortably in an entrepreneurial environment and seeks to continuously enhance own relevant skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge in Word, PowerPoint and Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with RFP content management systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

