929,&amp;quot;0 Man Body&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Our Technology Internship programme invites you to spend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;weeks &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;fully embedded in one of our teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;, tackling impactful projects that drive technological advancement and deliver meaningful business impact. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; receive formal training and comprehensive support from a dedicated &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt;buddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; and mentor who will guide your development and help you navigate the organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;0 Man Body&quot;&gt; We also host knowledge sharing sessions and intern-specific events to help you build a broader understanding of Man Group and the wider financial services industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
