&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an outstanding opportunity to join Man Group&#39;s Security Engineering team within Technology. Man Group&#39;s business is powered by sophisticated technology, with AI accelerating the next generation of transformation. Our technology stack is built on modern open-source components, both enabling day-to-day research and development and supporting our 24-hour trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With the adoption of AI agents, we are investing in security as a first-class concern. Man has a sophisticated AI platform – MAIA – that offers the best foundation models on our modern technology stack. As agents become more powerful, the security platform that supports safe agentic workflows is critical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Security Engineer to build and run the components that put these principles into practice: a policy engine and APIs that allow applications, AI agents and users to authenticate, with authorisation supported by scoped, short-lived credentials. This is a hands-on engineering role, securing Man&#39;s applications and services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Role Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and operate security platform services and APIs such as policy decision, just-in-time access and short-lived credential issuance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain policy-as-code that is tested, version-controlled and deployed through GitOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate the platform with identity providers (Entra/AD), secrets management (Vault) and existing internal infrastructure (Keycloak, Sailpoint)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run services to production standards for reliability, performance and observability, including 2nd line on-call support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement and Detection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Python APIs and onboard application teams and AI-agent developers to the platform, with documentation that makes the secure path the easy one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build logging, metrics and alerting for platform services, and contribute SIEM detection rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and operating production services with Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using Kubernetes, Linux and containerised environments, including networking fundamentals and performance troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of authentication, authorisation and secrets management (OIDC/OAuth, Azure AD/Entra ID, vault technologies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure-as-code (e.g., Terraform, Ansible, Helm) and GitOps-based deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of observability stacks (e.g., ELK, Prometheus, Grafana), including building dashboards and alerting rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and a structured approach to reasoning about risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantageous&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes knowledge beyond basic usage: network policies, pod security standards, admission controllers and resource quota enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Policy engines and workload identity (e.g., OPA/Rego, Kyverno, Cedar, OpenFGA, SPIFFE/SPIRE, Envoy/service mesh)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API design (REST/gRPC) for internal platform consumers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network security controls: WAFs, segmentation, TLS termination and egress filtering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Benefits &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office located in the OfficeX campus with easy access to transport and amenities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Premium Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Referral Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional days off for long service and volunteering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multisport card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional development including internal tech talks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conference attendance, and engagement with the open-source community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

c674b8ccc4d662a9b20a17a81a7736b6ae8ba8f4:
&lt;p&gt;Tower Research Capital is a leading quantitative trading firm founded in 1998. Tower has built its business on a high-performance platform and independent trading teams. We have a 25+ year track record of innovation and a reputation&amp;nbsp; for discovering unique market opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower is home to some of the world’s best systematic trading and engineering talent. We empower portfolio managers to build their teams and strategies independently while providing the economies of scale that come from a large, global organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineers thrive at Tower while developing electronic trading infrastructure at a world class level. Our engineers solve challenging problems in the realms of low-latency programming, FPGA technology, hardware acceleration and machine learning. Our ongoing investment in top engineering talent and technology ensures our platform remains unmatched in terms of functionality, scalability and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, every employee plays a role in our success. Our Business Support teams are essential to building and maintaining the platform that powers everything we do — combining market access, data, compute, and research infrastructure with risk management, compliance, and a full suite of business services. Our Business Support teams enable our trading and engineering teams to perform at their best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, employees will find a stimulating, results-oriented environment where highly intelligent and motivated colleagues inspire each other to reach their greatest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of the Business Management (APAC) team, the successful candidate will be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with trading teams to address business requirements, identifying market constraints, and implementing solutions that scale APAC operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing deep expertise in Japanese market structure, exchanges, liquidity, broker dynamics, and regulatory developments to serve as the regional subject matter expert over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting in building and managing relationships with exchanges, brokers, banks, and prime brokers across APAC, particularly in Japan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting in end-to-end strategic initiatives by coordinating across Legal, Compliance, Risk, Operations, Finance, and Technology teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing quantitative and commercial analysis to evaluate new products, trading infrastructure, venues, and market access opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing analytical frameworks, recommendations, and presentation materials for executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refining and scaling internal Business Management processes, reporting, and analytics as APAC operations expand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or higher with a strong academic background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of relevant financial markets experience, such as proprietary trading, investment banking, brokerage, exchanges, or market infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Japanese market structure and the broader electronic trading ecosystem, including market access, clearing, and market data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of independently owning cross-functional projects and managing diverse stakeholder relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and commercial judgment skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, low-ego mindset suited for a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Japanese strongly preferred for local exchange and broker engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Python, SQL, or other analytical tools is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower’s headquarters are in the historic Equitable Building, right in the heart of NYC’s Financial District and our impact is global, with over a dozen offices around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, we believe work should be both challenging and enjoyable. That is why we foster a culture where smart, driven people thrive – without the egos. Our open concept workplace, casual dress code, and well-stocked kitchens reflect the value we place on a friendly, collaborative environment where everyone is respected, and great ideas win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Savings plans and other financial wellness tools available in each region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast, lunch and snacks daily&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office wellness experiences and reimbursement for select wellness expenses (e.g., gym, personal training and more)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-sponsored sports teams and fitness events (JPM Corporate Challenge, Cycle for Survival, Wall Street Rides FAR and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteer opportunities and charitable giving&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, happy hours, treats and celebrations throughout the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workshops and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, you’ll find a collaborative and welcoming culture, a diverse team and a workplace that values both performance and enjoyment. No unnecessary hierarchy. No ego. Just great people doing great work – together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower Research Capital is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;

ff3b1d485ef743cdffea3f14ca20987badb72f54:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Tower Research Capital est une société renommée de négociation quantitative fondée en 1998. Tower a fondé ses affaires en se basant sur une plateforme à haute performance et sur des équipes de négociation indépendantes. Nous avons plus de 25 ans d’expérience en innovation et une réputation de découvrir des occasions uniques sur le marché.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Tower abrite certains des meilleurs talents mondiaux en matière de négociation systématique et d’ingénierie. Nous permettons aux gestionnaires de portefeuille de bâtir leurs équipes et leurs stratégies de façon indépendante tout en offrant les économies d’échelle qui proviennent d’une grande organisation mondiale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Les ingénieurs prospèrent chez Tower tout en développant une infrastructure de négociation électronique à un niveau de classe mondiale. Nos ingénieurs règlent des problèmes complexes dans les domaines de la programmation à faible latence, de la technologie FPGA, de l’accélération matérielle et de l’apprentissage automatique. Notre investissement continu dans les meilleurs talents d’ingénierie et dans les meilleures technologies garantit que notre plateforme demeure inégalée en termes de fonctionnalité, d’évolutivité et de performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;À Tower, chaque employé joue un rôle dans notre réussite. Nos équipes de soutien aux entreprises sont essentielles à la création et à la maintenance de la plateforme qui alimente toutes nos activités : elles réunissent l’accès au marché, les données, le calcul et l’infrastructure de recherche à la gestion des risques, la conformité et une gamme complète de services aux entreprises. Nos équipes de soutien aux entreprises permettent à nos équipes de négociation et d’ingénierie de donner le meilleur d’elles-mêmes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;À Tower, les employés trouveront un environnement stimulant et axé sur les résultats où des collègues très intelligents et motivés s’inspirent mutuellement pour atteindre leur plus grand potentiel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Vous rejoindrez une équipe répartie dans plusieurs bureaux, composée d’ingénieurs passionnés par les plateformes en tant que service (PaaS). Vos responsabilités comprendront les suivantes :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Concevoir, mettre en place, maintenir et exploiter des clusters Kubernetes sur des serveurs physiques (« bare metal »).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Développer des opérateurs Kubernetes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Prendre en charge, maintenir et développer les outils et la documentation destinés aux développeurs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Préparer les composants de la plateforme pour leur déploiement et en assurer la maintenance, notamment les services de traitement de données en continu, les orchestrateurs de données, les bases de données et les caches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribuer à l’innovation et à l’évolution de la plateforme.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exigences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une maîtrise ou un doctorat en informatique.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Au moins deux ans d’expérience professionnelle hors du milieu universitaire.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une expérience significative de Kubernetes, tant comme utilisateur que comme administrateur, constitue un atout important.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;La maîtrise d’un langage de programmation tel que Python, Rust, Go ou C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une bonne connaissance de la programmation système.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une solide connaissance de Linux ainsi que des compétences en administration système et en résolution de problèmes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une expérience pratique des méthodes et des outils d’observabilité constitue un atout important.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une expérience des systèmes distribués, tels que Kafka et etcd, constitue un atout important.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une connaissance générale des infrastructures et des protocoles liés notamment au DNS, aux réseaux et à la sécurité constitue un atout.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une connaissance de l’exploitation des GPU et du développement sur GPU constitue un atout.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une connaissance des pratiques d’intégration et de livraison continues (CI/CD) est appréciée.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une compréhension de base des solutions de stockage d’entreprise constitue un atout.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Une expérience de l’infrastructure en tant que code (IaC) ou des systèmes de gestion de configuration à grande échelle constitue un atout.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;De la curiosité et une volonté constante d’apprendre.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ce poste exige une maîtrise du français et de l’anglais, tant à l’oral qu’à l’écrit. La maîtrise de l’anglais est requise, puisque le poste implique des interactions régulières avec des membres anglophones internationaux de l’équipe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Le siège social de Tower est situé dans l’édifice Équitable, au plein cœur du district financier de New York. Toutefois, notre influence est mondiale, et nous avons plus d’une douzaine de bureaux dans le monde entier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;À Tower, nous croyons que le travail devrait être à la fois stimulant et agréable. C’est pourquoi nous favorisons une culture où les personnes intelligentes et motivées prospèrent, sans les egos. Notre milieu de travail à concept ouvert, notre code vestimentaire décontracté et nos cuisines bien approvisionnées reflètent la valeur que nous accordons à un environnement amical et collaboratif où tout le monde est respecté et où les bonnes idées sont gagnantes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Politiques généreuses de congés payés&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Régimes d’épargne et autres outils de bien-être financier disponibles dans chaque région&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Occasions de travail hybride&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Déjeuner, dîner et collations gratuits quotidiennement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Expériences de bien-être au bureau et remboursement de certaines dépenses de bien-être (p. ex., centre de conditionnement physique, entraînement personnel et plus encore)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Occasions de bénévolat et dons de charité&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Événements sociaux, cinq à sept, friandises et célébrations tout au long de l’année&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ateliers et occasions d’apprentissage continu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;À Tower, vous trouverez une culture collaborative et accueillante, une équipe diversifiée et un milieu de travail qui valorise à la fois le rendement et le plaisir. Pas de hiérarchie inutile. Pas d’ego. Juste des gens formidables qui font un travail formidable, ensemble.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Tower Research Capital est un employeur qui souscrit au principe de l’égalité d’accès à l’emploi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;[ENG]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Tower Research Capital is a leading quantitative trading firm founded in 1998. Tower has built its business on a high-performance platform and independent trading teams. We have a 25+ year track record of innovation and a reputation for discovering unique market opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Tower is home to some of the world’s best systematic trading and engineering talent. We empower portfolio managers to build their teams and strategies independently while providing the economies of scale that come from a large, global organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Engineers thrive at Tower while developing electronic trading infrastructure at a world class level. Our engineers solve challenging problems in the realms of low-latency programming, FPGA technology, hardware acceleration and machine learning. Our ongoing investment in top engineering talent and technology ensures our platform remains unmatched in terms of functionality, scalability and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At Tower, every employee plays a role in our success. Our Business Support teams are essential to building and maintaining the platform that powers everything we do — combining market access, data, compute, and research infrastructure with risk management, compliance, and a full suite of business services. Our Business Support teams enable our trading and engineering teams to perform at their best.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At Tower, employees will find a stimulating, results-oriented environment where highly intelligent and motivated colleagues inspire each other to reach their greatest potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will be joining a distributed team of passionate Platform as a Service engineers, with the responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Designing, build, maintain and operate bare metal Kubernetes clusters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Developing Kubernetes operator&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Owning, maintain, develop tooling and documentation for developers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Packaging, maintain platform as a service build blocks such as stream services, data orchestrators, databases, caches, etc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bringing innovation to the Platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;An academic background (MSc or PhD) in computer science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Some experience outside of academia (2+ years)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Significant experience with Kubernetes as a user and as administrator is a big plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in one programming language such as Python, Rust, Go, C++&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Good knowledge of system programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of Linux and system administration and troubleshooting skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working experience with observability practices and tooling is a big plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with distributed systems such as Kafka, Etcd is a big plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;General knowledge of infrastructure and protocols in domains such as DNS, Networking, Security, etc is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with GPU operations and development is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CICD practices is appreciated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Basic understanding of enterprise storage solution is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with infrastructure as code and/or large scale configuration management system is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Curiosity and a constant drive to learn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This position requires proficiency in both French and English, both spoken and written. English proficiency is required as the position involves regular interactions with international anglophone team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Tower’s headquarters are in the historic Equitable Building, right in the heart of NYC’s Financial District and our impact is global, with over a dozen offices around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At Tower, we believe work should be both challenging and enjoyable. That is why we foster a culture where smart, driven people thrive – without the egos. Our open concept workplace, casual dress code, and well-stocked kitchens reflect the value we place on a friendly, collaborative environment where everyone is respected, and great ideas win.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Generous paid time off policies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Savings plans and other financial wellness tools available in each region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hybrid working opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Free breakfast, lunch, and snacks daily&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;In-office wellness experiences and reimbursement for select wellness expenses (e.g., gym, personal training and more)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Volunteer opportunities and charitable giving&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Social events, happy hours, treats, and celebrations throughout the year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Workshops and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At Tower, you’ll find a collaborative and welcoming culture, a diverse team and a workplace that values both performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

9bda6b66278292842738c4d28851870727cca1a6:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Old Mission is a global proprietary trading firm that leverages state-of-the-art technology and research to identify and execute profitable trading strategies across multiple asset classes around the world. Our offices in Chicago, New York, and London are all composed of naturally-curious individuals who thrive in a team environment and constantly strive for improvement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Old Mission is looking for an ETF Sales Trader in our London office that will help build and maintain meaningful trading relationships on behalf of the firm. This individual will work with our institutional clients to execute their trading strategies, leveraging Old Mission’s technology and global trading desks to deliver a positive and consistent experience. Still a small, yet growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage relationships with institutional clients of the firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our principal trading desks, serving as a central point of contact between internal stakeholders and our external clients and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure efficient execution of ETF block orders via RFQ platforms or voice, as well as working orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross sell with other global trading desks within Old Mission (US ETFs, Equities, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel / attend industry events and client meetings as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist clients with pre/post trade information as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years’ experience in a sales trading role (Fixed Income, ETFs and/or Equities)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working orders and/or executing portfolios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of sell-side OMS – FlexTrade preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TradeWeb&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and attention to detail - working with customers &amp;amp; internal trade desks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player and go-getter attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with European Institutional clients are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Series 7 is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Old Mission is not accepting unsolicited resumes from any staffing/search firms. All resumes submitted by staffing/search firms to any employee at Old Mission via-email, the Internet or directly without a valid signed search agreement will be deemed the sole property of Old Mission, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by Old Mission.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

48df8e008089ebd4f6650df07d8aaeb303264fab:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Old Mission is a global proprietary trading firm that leverages state-of-the-art technology and research to identify and execute profitable trading strategies across multiple asset classes around the world. Our offices in Chicago, New York, and London are all composed of naturally-curious individuals who thrive in a team environment and constantly strive for improvement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our quant trading interns will explore new trading strategies, engage in mock trading, take part in quantitative research, and develop related software. Our interns will participate in the firm’s education program, getting a chance to learn about all aspects of trading and financial markets both formally (in classes) and on-the-job. The internship program will start on January 4th, 2027, and conclude on January 22nd, 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong quantitative background and familiarity with probability and statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An undergraduate degree in a quantitative field such as computer science, engineering, or one of the hard sciences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduating in December 2027 or May 2028&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work and solve problems as part of a team, often in a high-pressure environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven trustworthiness and performance under the highest ethical standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong desire for knowledge and to understand how things work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong work ethic and ability to adapt quickly in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp, motivated co-workers in a fast-paced office environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully stocked kitchen, free breakfast and lunch every day on-site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Housing provided&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$2,500 per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Old Mission is not accepting unsolicited resumes from any staffing/search firms. All resumes submitted by staffing/search firms to any employee at Old Mission via-email, the Internet or directly without a valid signed search agreement will be deemed the sole property of Old Mission, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by Old Mission.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

1aacd6ce3c544e661d7a8e8b21a2867ccd8aa26c:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Acquisition, Associate (Recruiter)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an exceptionally talented Recruiter to join our Talent Acquisition team in New York. A successful candidate will have demonstrated experience managing the full lifecycle of recruitment, providing best a best-in-class candidate experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will work closely across multiple different teams to execute on the firm’s talent acquisition strategy and will have a strong emphasis on managing roles across the front office landscape including Quants, Strategists, Risk and Technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner with the business to run the entire recruiting process, providing support and expertise to the teams you are working with. You will utilize and grow your network, identify high quality candidates, provide key search updates and continuously offer guidance as searches evolve. You will manage the candidate experience, ensuring excellent communication and engagement throughout the process and serve as a main point of contact for candidates as they go through the process. You will develop a big picture understanding of our business, brand &amp;amp; values, and act as a champion of our tag line “Talent is our strategy.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you need:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of lateral recruiting experience in financial services with a mixture of inhouse and agency experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting Quant/Strat roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of key terminology, programming languages and business acumen across the quant space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running a process from start to finish acting as a trusted advisor throughout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build excellent relationships with internal stakeholders and search firms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and willingness to support roles outside of Quant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, demanding environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail; Exceptionally organized and detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, verbal and non-verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We would love if you had:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting in international markets (Latam, EMEA for example)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who we are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Schonfeld is a global multi-manager hedge fund that strives to deliver industry-leading risk-adjusted returns for our investors. We leverage both internal and external portfolio manager teams around the world, seeking to capitalize on inefficiencies and opportunities within the markets. We draw from decades of experience and a significant investment in proprietary technology, infrastructure and risk analytics to invest across four main strategies: Quant, Tactical, Fundamental Equity and Discretionary Macro &amp;amp; Fixed Income.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Our Culture&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Schonfeld, we’ll invest in you. Attracting and retaining top talent is at the heart of what we do, because we believe that exceptional outcomes begin with exceptional people. We foster a culture where talent is empowered to continually learn, innovate and pursue ambitious goals. We are teamwork-oriented, collaborative and encourage ideas—at all levels—to be shared. As an organization committed to investing in our people, we provide learning and educational offerings and opportunities to make an impact. We encourage community through internal networks, external partnerships and service initiatives that promote inclusion and purpose beyond the firm’s walls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
