&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Internship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Kick-start your career in finance with the Schonfeld Summer Internship! Over the course of 10 action-packed weeks, you will have the opportunity to build solutions that tackle real-world challenges and leave a lasting impact on the firm. As an intern, you’ll join a close-knit team that is ready to support your growth and accelerate your career. We will pair you with a dedicated manager and a mentor who’ll guide your development over the course of the internship and beyond. Throughout the program, you will have the chance to connect with senior leaders through a series of learning sessions, attend hands-on skills workshops, network at social events and get a behind-the-scenes look at how various functions power the firm. We’ll empower you to bring your ideas to life and make an impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Schonfeld is a global multi-manager hedge fund that strives to deliver industry-leading risk-adjusted returns for our investors. We leverage both internal and external portfolio manager teams around the world, seeking to capitalize on inefficiencies and opportunities within the markets. We draw from decades of experience and a significant investment in proprietary technology, infrastructure and risk analytics to invest across four main strategies: Quant, Tactical, Fundamental Equity and Discretionary Macro &amp;amp; Fixed Income.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At Schonfeld, we’ll invest in you. Attracting and retaining top talent is at the heart of what we do, because we believe that exceptional outcomes begin with exceptional people. We foster a culture where talent is empowered to continually learn, innovate and pursue ambitious goals. We are teamwork-oriented, collaborative and encourage ideas—at all levels—to be shared. As an organization committed to investing in our people, we provide learning and educational offerings and opportunities to make an impact. We encourage community through internal networks, external partnerships and service initiatives that promote inclusion and purpose beyond the firm’s walls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[7304],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The annual base pay for this role is expected to be between $175,000 and $220,000. Internship pay will be prorated based on the internship start and end dates. The expected base pay range is based on information at the time this post was generated. Actual compensation for the successful candidate will be determined based on a variety of factors such as skills, qualifications and experience and level of education.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;__symantecMPKIClientDetector&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;__PRESENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

036dbf9b104aa01d9018572456d0f9923c8c6fa9:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is one of the world&#39;s largest active investment managers, with over $228 billion in assets under management.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Systematic&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Systematic — formed by Man AHL and Man Numeric — is one of the largest and most diversified systematic investment platforms in the world, managing in the region of $150 billion across hedge funds, long-only programmes, total return strategies, and bespoke Solutions mandates.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For&amp;nbsp;over &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;35&amp;nbsp;years&lt;/strong&gt;, AHL and Numeric have been blending techniques from machine learning, statistics, and physics with world-class engineering to stay ahead of the curve — research-driven, technology-native, and obsessive about the integrity of the investment process from data to execution. It&#39;s a place where smart, curious people from all kinds of backgrounds come together to solve genuinely hard problems and see their ideas make a real impact in financial markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The combined platform offers exposure to&amp;nbsp;virtually every&amp;nbsp;systematic style and asset class on the market — including trend &amp;amp; quant macro, vol, credit, EMN &amp;amp; stat arb, alpha capture, risk premia, beta+, and target risk. More at &lt;a target=&quot;, _blank&quot;&gt;www.man.com/ahl&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp; &lt;a target=&quot;, _blank&quot;&gt;www.man.com/numeric&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team: Systematic Portfolio Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Systematic Portfolio Analytics has been a core function within Man AHL for the past four years and is now expanding its mandate to cover the entirety of Man Systematic — both AHL and Numeric. This is not a new team finding its feet; it is a proven, established function with a strong track record inside AHL, now scaling up to deliver across one of the largest systematic platforms in the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mandate is to deliver quantifiable, transparent, and actionable insights across the entire systematic estate — from individual signals all the way through to fund-level outcomes. We are an integral part of the decision-making process, helping determine where research effort and risk capital should be allocated, and our work is a fundamental node in the feedback loop between research, portfolio management, and the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining now means joining at a genuinely exciting inflection point: a battle-tested team, a proven playbook, and a step-change in scope — with the opportunity to help shape how Portfolio Analytics is built out across Numeric and the combined platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care more about raw ability, curiosity and drive than years of experience. The ideal candidate is someone who:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is a genuine self-starter — comfortable defining their own problems and running with them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has extremely high attention to detail — the kind of person who notices the thing nobody else notices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is entrepreneurial — sees gaps and fills them, without needing to be asked&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is constantly curious about the &quot;why&quot; — never satisfied with a surface-level answer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loves solving problems — and gets energy from hard, ambiguous ones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is excited by AI and modern tooling, and proactive about integrating it into their workflow&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aggressively adopt AI and&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;tooling to multiply your own output and the team&#39;s output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with — and make sense of — vast amounts of data across both AHL and Numeric&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop analytics, KPIs and metrics that turn raw data into intelligence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out research aimed at uncovering non-obvious insights about our strategies, signals and portfolios&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write code, build reporting mechanisms, and create tools that PMs and researchers actually use&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly build a deep understanding of the systematic estate, and leverage that knowledge to generate cross-functional insights and synergies between AHL and Numeric&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with PMs, researchers, technologists and traders on both sides of the Atlantic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Essential&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical &amp;amp; statistical skills — and able to translate them into pragmatic, real-world solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with large datasets and risk management techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in a high-level programming language (ideally Python) and its scientific stack (NumPy / SciPy / Pandas or similar)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advantageous&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern AI tooling (LLMs, agentic workflows, Claude Code / Codex CLI)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure in key areas on the sell-side, e.g. Trading, Risk, QIS, Financial Engineering, Strats / Quants, Portfolio Management, Electronic / Systematic Trading&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience analyzing or managing complex risk&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux, SQL / Oracle, KDB+&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong academic record from a leading&amp;nbsp;university, with a degree&amp;nbsp;containing&amp;nbsp;high mathematical,&amp;nbsp;statistical&amp;nbsp;and computing content (e.g. Mathematics, Computer Science, Engineering, Economics, Physics, or Statistics)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen interest in financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on attitude; willing to get involved with technology and projects across the firm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually robust, with a positive attitude to ambiguity and hard problems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-organized, able to manage time effectively across multiple competing priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills; able to build close working relationships with quantitative researchers, technologists, traders and senior business people alike&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communicator; able to argue a point concisely and deal positively with conflicting views&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of integrity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The anticipated based salary range for this position is listed below. Compensation packages would also include benefits and a discretionary bonus. This is the base salary range that the Company believes it will pay for this position at the time of this posting based on the location and requirements of the position as well as the skills, qualifications, and experience of the applicant.&amp;nbsp; The Firm reserves the right to modify this pay range at any time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

8c2bc5f5419f9e55ccc0f840c4ab70dde6e82172:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The IAM team aims to enable fast, secure and precise access to the resources people and systems need across Man Group. As the firm expands its use of AI agents, it must bring greater discipline to machine identities: knowing what each identity is for, who owns it, what it can access and when it should be retired. The Technical Analyst will help build that capability, starting with the service-account estate. This is a hybrid governance and technical role. You will investigate gaps in ownership, lifecycle management and access permissions; work with teams to resolve them; and use Python, automation and appropriate AI-assisted tools to make governance more effective and sustainable at scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Role Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Machine-Identity Lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish and operate processes for creating service accounts, assigning ownership, requesting and approving permissions and group memberships, reviewing access, and changing or retiring accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate existing accounts to establish their owner, purpose, usage, access and dependencies; work with relevant teams to resolve missing or inaccurate information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify dormant, unowned or otherwise problematic accounts and coordinate remediation, with appropriate care for operational dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain auditable records of ownership, decisions, exceptions and lifecycle changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation and Control Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish and operate processes for creating service accounts, assigning ownership, requesting and approving permissions and group memberships, reviewing access, and changing or retiring accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate existing accounts to establish their owner, purpose, usage, access and dependencies; work with relevant teams to resolve missing or inaccurate information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify dormant, unowned or otherwise problematic accounts and coordinate remediation, with appropriate care for operational dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain auditable records of ownership, decisions, exceptions and lifecycle changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with application and platform teams to understand how service accounts are used and how they can safely be brought onto a governed lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help make the governed path straightforward for teams creating new machine identities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate operational problems into practical requirements for IAM engineers and platform owners, and help validate the resulting changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shared Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute relevant IAM processes while recommending improvements to policies, procedures and controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team objectives and key results (OKRs), key performance indicators (KPIs), documentation and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, document and escalate security risks, working constructively with stakeholders to resolve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Python to analyse data and automate operational or governance tasks; able to write, test, troubleshoot and maintain your own scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of identity and access management concepts, including account lifecycle, access ownership and review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to investigate incomplete or inconsistent data, reach a defensible conclusion and follow an issue through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with technical teams and communicating clearly with non-technical account owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgement about when a script is sufficient and when a change needs an engineer-led, production-grade solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantageous&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in using AI-assisted tooling to improve investigation, data quality and governance workflows, while recognising where outputs need validation and decisions require human accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

94d976cda3bfe456eb8840f2bee7b5f53ed9216c:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firm Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verition Fund Management LLC (“Verition”) is a multi-strategy, multi-manager hedge fund founded in 2008. Verition focuses on global investment strategies including Fixed Income &amp;amp; Macro, Event &amp;amp; Multi-Asset RV, Equity L/S &amp;amp; Capital Markets, and Quantitative Trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verition is seeking an organized, proactive Administrative Assistant to provide dedicated administrative and logistical support to a Business Head. The role involves extensive calendar management, meeting coordination, travel arrangements, and expense administration, helping manage competing demands efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate demonstrates sound judgment, strong attention to detail, and the ability to anticipate needs and adapt to changing priorities. This opportunity is suited to candidates with 0 -5 years of relevant experience who are eager to learn, take ownership, and build strong working relationships in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the Business Head’s calendar, coordinating internal and external meetings across time zones, resolving scheduling conflicts, and accommodating changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate meeting logistics, including conference room reservations, attendee communications, materials, and catering as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arrange office access and visitor passes, reserve office space and meeting rooms, and liaise with reception and office management to ensure a seamless experience for the Business Head and guests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make lunch and dinner reservations and coordinate catering, accounting for timing, location, dietary requirements, and attendee preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arrange travel and accommodations for candidates attending interviews with the Business Head, prepare itineraries, communicate logistical details, and manage changes as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconcile corporate credit card transactions, collect receipts, prepare expense reports, and resolve discrepancies in accordance with firm policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records of reservations, travel arrangements, and expenses, ensuring timely follow-through on outstanding items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with colleagues, internal support teams, and external vendors on the Business Head’s behalf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate scheduling and logistical needs, identify potential issues, and take initiative to keep the day running smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle ad hoc administrative requests and projects, managing confidential information with discretion and professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0-5 years of experience in administrative support, executive assistance, or a related role; recent graduates are welcome to apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and time management skills, with the ability to prioritize competing requests and meet deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail and a commitment to accuracy across scheduling, reservations, travel, and expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills and a professional approach to interacting with colleagues, candidates, and external contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment and discretion when handling confidential or sensitive information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, service-oriented approach, with the ability to anticipate needs, solve problems, and follow tasks through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office, particularly Outlook, Word, and Excel, and the ability to learn new systems quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced, dynamic environment, remaining composed and adaptable as priorities change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work ethic, intellectual curiosity, and a willingness to learn and take on new responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with calendar management, travel booking, or expense reporting systems is a plus; financial services experience is helpful but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The annual base salary range for this position is $80,000 to $100,000 (USD). In addition to base salary, this position is eligible for a discretionary performance bonus and a comprehensive benefits package. Actual compensation offered to the successful candidate will be determined based on a variety of factors such as geographic location, work experience, qualifications, and skill level.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$80,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

645e88679ae2f272e6a3b08c8fe8a410d05c5df2:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Investment Analyst Financials Equity Long/Short &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Financials Equity Long/Short &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Dallas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firm Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verition Fund Management LLC (“Verition”) is a multi-strategy, multi-manager hedge fund founded in 2008. Verition focuses on global investment strategies including Credit, Fixed Income &amp;amp; Macro, Convertible &amp;amp; Volatility Arbitrage, Event-Driven, Equity Long/Short &amp;amp; Capital Markets, and Quantitative Strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and detail-oriented Investment Analyst to join a Financials Long/Short team. The candidate must have 1-3 years of experience in Investment Banking, Private Equity, Equity Research, and or Consulting with a strong academic background and a proven track record of excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Conduct in-depth fundamental research and analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Develop and maintain detailed financial models and valuation analyses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Monitor industry trends, competitive dynamics, and macroeconomic factors impacting the sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Support portfolio manager in portfolio construction and risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Participate in meetings with company management teams, industry experts, and sell-side analysts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Continuously update and improve investment theses based on new information and market developments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 1-3 years of relevant experience in Investment Banking, Private Equity, Equity Research and or Consulting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong analytical and quantitative skills with a solid understanding of financial statements, modeling, and valuation techniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- High level of intellectual curiosity, strong work ethic, and a keen attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Ability to work effectively in a team-oriented, fast-paced, and dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The annual base salary range for this position is $150,000 to $200,000 (USD). In addition to base salary, this position is eligible for a discretionary performance bonus and a comprehensive benefits package. Actual compensation offered to the successful candidate will be determined based on a variety of factors such as geographic location, work experience, qualifications, and skill level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

ccfd22290c96d3fb8716e8aaf33e3bf26cd18e65:
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[Français]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tower Research Capital est une société renommée de négociation quantitative fondée en 1998. Tower a fondé ses affaires en se basant sur une plateforme à haute performance et sur des équipes de négociation indépendantes. Nous avons plus de 25 ans d’expérience en innovation et une réputation de découvrir des occasions uniques sur le marché.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tower abrite certains des meilleurs talents mondiaux en matière de négociation systématique et d’ingénierie. Nous permettons aux gestionnaires de portefeuille de bâtir leurs équipes et leurs stratégies de façon indépendante tout en offrant les économies d’échelle qui proviennent d’une grande organisation mondiale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Les ingénieurs prospèrent chez Tower tout en développant une infrastructure de négociation électronique à un niveau de classe mondiale. Nos ingénieurs règlent des problèmes complexes dans les domaines de la programmation à faible latence, de la technologie FPGA, de l’accélération matérielle et de l’apprentissage automatique. Notre investissement continu dans les meilleurs talents d’ingénierie et dans les meilleures technologies garantit que notre plateforme demeure inégalée en termes de fonctionnalité, d’évolutivité et de performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;À Tower, chaque employé joue un rôle dans notre réussite. Nos équipes de soutien aux entreprises sont essentielles à la création et à la maintenance de la plateforme qui alimente toutes nos activités : elles réunissent l’accès au marché, les données, le calcul et l’infrastructure de recherche à la gestion des risques, la conformité et une gamme complète de services aux entreprises. Nos équipes de soutien aux entreprises permettent à nos équipes de négociation et d’ingénierie de donner le meilleur d’elles-mêmes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;À Tower, les employés trouveront un environnement stimulant et axé sur les résultats où des collègues très intelligents et motivés s’inspirent mutuellement pour atteindre leur plus grand potentiel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;L’équipe Ingénierie Core cherche un développeur en logiciels II pour se joindre à notre équipe des données. En tant que développeur en logiciels de notre équipe des données, vous serez responsable de la conception, de la mise en œuvre et du maintien de l’infrastructure nécessaire au soutien des processus de gestion des données de l’entreprise. Vous travaillerez en étroite collaboration avec l’équipe des services de données, les équipes de gestion de portefeuille et d’autres équipes des TI pour assurer la fiabilité, la sécurité et l’évolutivité de nos systèmes de données.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Notre département Core Engineering recherche un développeur ou une développeuse logiciel pour rejoindre l’équipe Data à Montréal. La personne retenue jouera un rôle clé dans le développement de l’infrastructure de données de référence sur les instruments financiers de Tower.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Architecture axée sur les données : Concevoir et développer des pipelines ETL d’ingestion de données hautement fiables, capables de traiter des flux fragmentés et multiformats provenant de bourses mondiales et de fournisseurs de données (p. ex., Bloomberg, Refinitiv), puis de les normaliser selon notre modèle de données interne.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Modélisation complexe : Analyser en profondeur la structure des instruments financiers de différentes catégories d’actifs (actions, cryptoactifs, produits dérivés complexes, etc.) afin de développer des modèles de données complets et cohérents dans le temps pour les nouvelles catégories d’actifs intégrées, ou de faire évoluer nos modèles relationnels et de séries chronologiques existants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Détection des anomalies et contrôle de la qualité des données : Développer des mécanismes automatisés et intelligents de rapprochement et de contrôle de la qualité des données historiques et en temps réel, afin de détecter, de corriger ou de signaler les erreurs provenant des sources de données en amont.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaboration interfonctionnelle : Collaborer directement avec les chercheurs quantitatifs, les traders et les autres équipes d’ingénierie centrale afin de développer des solutions complètes de données de référence répondant aux besoins des différentes fonctions de la plateforme de négociation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;De 2 à 5 ans d’expérience dans le secteur de la négociation financière ou des technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solide expertise en bases de données SQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maîtrise de la programmation en Python ou en Java, ou dans les deux langages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Aisance dans un environnement UNIX et bonnes compétences en programmation de scripts shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solides compétences en résolution de problèmes axée sur les données, avec une capacité à maîtriser les modèles de données sous-jacents pour orienter le développement de logiciels robustes et évolutifs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellentes capacités d’analyse et d’investigation, avec une expérience démontrée dans l’interprétation de documentation technique et la rétro-ingénierie de cas limites&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Diplôme en informatique ou dans un domaine connexe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Expérience avec les données de référence sur les instruments financiers utilisées en négociation, idéalement dans plusieurs catégories d’actifs : actions, produits dérivés, devises et titres à revenu fixe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellentes compétences en communication écrite et orale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Notre siège social de Tower est situé dans l’édifice Équitable, au plein cœur du district financier de New York. Toutefois, notre influence est mondiale, et nous avons plus d’une douzaine de bureaux dans le monde entier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;À Tower, nous croyons que le travail devrait être à la fois stimulant et agréable. C’est pourquoi nous favorisons une culture où les personnes intelligentes et motivées prospèrent, sans les egos. Notre milieu de travail à concept ouvert, notre code vestimentaire décontracté et nos cuisines bien approvisionnées reflètent la valeur que nous accordons à un environnement amical et collaboratif où tout le monde est respecté et où les bonnes idées sont gagnantes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Politiques généreuses de congés payés&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Régimes d’épargne et autres outils de bien-être financier disponibles dans chaque région&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Occasions de travail hybride&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Déjeuner, dîner et collations gratuits quotidiennement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Expériences de bien-être au bureau et remboursement de certaines dépenses de bien-être (p. ex., centre de conditionnement physique, entraînement personnel et plus encore)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Occasions de bénévolat et dons de charité&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Événements sociaux, cinq à sept, friandises et célébrations tout au long de l’année&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ateliers et occasions d’apprentissage continu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;À Tower, vous trouverez une culture collaborative et accueillante, une équipe diversifiée et un milieu de travail qui valorise à la fois le rendement et le plaisir. Pas de hiérarchie inutile. Pas d’ego. Juste des gens formidables qui font un travail formidable, ensemble.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tower Research Capital est un employeur qui souscrit au principe de l’égalité d’accès à l’emploi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[English]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tower Research Capital is a leading quantitative trading firm founded in 1998. Tower has built its business on a high-performance platform and independent trading teams. We have a 25+ year track record of innovation and a reputation&amp;nbsp; for discovering unique market opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tower is home to some of the world’s best systematic trading and engineering talent. We empower portfolio managers to build their teams and strategies independently while providing the economies of scale that come from a large, global organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Engineers thrive at Tower while developing electronic trading infrastructure at a world class level. Our engineers solve challenging problems in the realms of low-latency programming, FPGA technology, hardware acceleration and machine learning. Our ongoing investment in top engineering talent and technology ensures our platform remains unmatched in terms of functionality, scalability and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Tower, every employee plays a role in our success. Our Business Support teams are essential to building and maintaining the platform that powers everything we do — combining market access, data, compute, and research infrastructure with risk management, compliance, and a full suite of business services. Our Business Support teams enable our trading and engineering teams to perform at their best.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Tower, employees will find a stimulating, results-oriented environment where highly intelligent and motivated colleagues inspire each other to reach their greatest potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our Core Engineering department is seeking a Software Developer to join the Data team in Montreal. This role will play a key part in contributing to Tower’s security referential infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Data-Driven Architecture: Design and build highly reliable data ingestion ETL pipelines that consume fragmented, multi-format feeds from global exchanges and data vendors (e.g., Bloomberg, Refinitiv) and normalize them into our pristine internal data model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Complex Modeling: Dig deep into the anatomy of financial instruments for different asset classes (such as equities, crypto, complex derivatives) to develop complete and historically consistent data models for newly on-boarded asset classes or to continuously evolve our existing relational and time-series data models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Anomaly Detection and Data Quality Checks: Build automated, intelligent reconciliation and data-quality frameworks for historical and live data that catch, resolve and/or flag errors from upstream data sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Partner directly with quantitative researchers, traders, and other core engineering teams to build complete referential data solutions that serve the different functions across the trading stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;2-5 years of experience working in the financial trading or technology industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in SQL databases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proficient in either Python and/or Jav programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Comfortable working in an UNIX environment along with good shell scripting skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong data-first problem-solving skills, focused on mastering underlying data models to guide building robust, scalable software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Deep analytical and investigative abilities, with a proven track record of parsing technical documentation and reverse-engineering edge cases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A degree in computer science or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience working with security referential data for financial trading across a variety of asset classes - equities, derivatives, fx, fixed income preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tower’s headquarters are in the historic Equitable Building, right in the heart of NYC’s Financial District and our impact is global, with over a dozen offices around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Tower, we believe work should be both challenging and enjoyable. That is why we foster a culture where smart, driven people thrive – without the egos. Our open concept workplace, casual dress code, and well-stocked kitchens reflect the value we place on a friendly, collaborative environment where everyone is respected, and great ideas win.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Generous paid time off policies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Savings plans and other financial wellness tools available in each region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hybrid working opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Free breakfast, lunch, and snacks daily&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In-office wellness experiences and reimbursement for select wellness expenses (e.g., gym, personal training and more)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Volunteer opportunities and charitable giving&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Social events, happy hours, treats, and celebrations throughout the year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Workshops and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Tower, you’ll find a collaborative and welcoming culture, a diverse team and a workplace that values both performance and enjoyment. No unnecessary hierarchy. No ego. Just great people doing great work – together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tower Research Capital is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
